A Node.js endpoint becomes slower over several hours. Heap usage rises steadily, and this module is on the hot path:

```js
const cache = new Map();

export async function getUser(id) {
  if (!cache.has(id)) {
    cache.set(id, await fetchUser(id));
  }
  return cache.get(id);
}
```

Diagnose the most likely issue, explain how you would confirm it, and propose a safe fix. Mention important trade-offs or edge cases.

